# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/),
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

## [Unreleased]

## [0.1.1] - 2026-07-30

### Fixed

- Removed stray test log files that were accidentally included in the
  `0.1.0` published package due to missing `exclude` rules in `Cargo.toml`.

## [0.1.0] - 2026-07-30

### Added

- Initial release of `multipart_parser`.
- Streaming, chunk-based `MultiPartParser` for parsing `multipart/*` request bodies.
- Configurable limits: `max_header_size`, `max_body_limit_until_file`, `max_file_size`.
- Automatic spillover of large parts to temporary files via `tempfile`.
- `MultiPart` struct exposing `headers`, `data`, and `content_type`.
- `DataType` enum representing part data as either in-memory `Bytes` or an on-disk `File`.
- `MultiPartParserError` error type covering malformed boundaries, exceeded size
  limits, malicious parts, and unexpected stream termination, with
  `std::error::Error` and `Display` implementations.

